/// Safe HTML. Markup is written as html"..." literals (type Html): every ${x}
/// is escaped for its context (text, attribute, URL, script, style), an Html
/// value is inserted as it is, a List[Html] is concatenated.
/// raw marks text as trusted markup WITHOUT escaping: use it only for markup
/// you wrote or sanitized yourself, never for user input.
fn raw(text: Str) -> Html {}
